{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2021-09-15 07:30:00', 'title': 'BIOGEN PLANS TO INITIATE PHASE 3B STUDY EVALUATING POTENTIAL BENEFIT OF A HIGHER DOSE OF NUSINERSEN IN PATIENTS PREVIOUSLY TREATED WITH EVRYSDI® (RISDIPLAM)', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS., SEPT. 15, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO INITIATE A GLOBAL PHASE 3B CLINICAL STUDY, ASCEND. THE ASCEND STUDY IS DESIGNED TO EVALUATE THE CLINICAL OUTCOMES AND ASSESS THE SAFETY OF A HIGHER DOSE OF NUSINERSEN* IN CHILDREN, TEENS AND ADULTS WITH LATER-ONSET SPINAL MUSCULAR ATROPHY (SMA) FOLLOWING TREATMENT WITH EVRYSDI® (RISDIPLAM).'}